392"}}, "image": {"url": "https://images.qloo.com/i/D4D1E309-98CE-4C83-85E0-EA0B208C1B37-420x-auto.jpg"}, "platforms": ["PC"], "publisher": "Strategy First", "release_date": "2023-02-22", "release_year": 2023, "short_description": "Command your fleet in strategic naval battles and manage resources to dominate the seas during a historical conflict.", "short_descriptions": [{"language": "de", "value": "Führe deine Flotte in strategischen Seeschlachten und verwalte Ressourcen, um während eines historischen Konflikts die Meere zu beherrschen."}, {"language": "es", "value": "Comanda tu flota en batallas navales estratégicas y gestiona recursos para dominar los mares durante un conflicto histórico."}, {"language": "fr", "value": "Commandez votre flotte dans des batailles navales stratégiques et gérez les ressources pour dominer les mers lors d'un conflit historique."}, {"language": "en", "value": "Command your fleet in strategic naval battles and manage resources to dominate the seas during a historical conflict."}]}, "popularity": 0.9799952916923469, "disambiguation": "2023-02-22, Totem Games", "tags": [{"name": "Strategy", "tag_id": "urn:tag:genre:media:strategy", "type": "urn:tag:genre:media", "value": "urn:tag:genre:media:strategy"}]}]}}